H("674.d.1.A",3,"Which source would give a student the clearest picture of what a software intern does each week?","A company's internship posting listing responsibilities",["A random social media meme","A weather forecast","A cafeteria menu"],"Postings describe the duties and tasks of a role.")
H("674.d.1.A",4,"Two postings for the same entry-level programming role list different required tasks. What is the best way to decide which fits your goals?","Compare the listed duties against the skills you want to build",["Pick the one with the shorter title","Apply to neither","Choose whichever has the longer company name"],"Matching duties to your goals is the useful comparison.")
H("674.d.1.B",3,"A portfolio of finished programs helps an applicant mainly by:","showing real examples of their work",["replacing the need for any skills","listing only their hobbies","hiding their projects from employers"],"Portfolios give employers evidence of ability.")
H("674.d.1.B",4,"An industry certification on a resume most directly signals that the applicant has:","passed an exam proving a specific skill set",["finished every college course","worked ten years in the field","a guaranteed job offer"],"Certifications verify particular skills.")
H("674.d.1.C",3,"Before using an unfamiliar method in a library, a programmer should first consult its:","API documentation",["wallpaper settings","printer queue","screen saver"],"Documentation explains how methods are used.")
H("674.d.1.C",4,"Which comment best supports technical writing standards in a code file?","A short note explaining why the loop skips the first item",["A note saying 'stuff happens here'","A joke unrelated to the code","An empty line of dashes only"],"Good comments explain intent clearly and briefly.")
H("674.d.1.D",3,"During a code review, a developer disagrees with a suggestion. Which response shows effective verbal communication?","Explain the reasoning calmly and ask for the reviewer's view",["Interrupt and raise your voice","Say nothing and ignore the comment","Walk away from the meeting"],"Calm, two-way discussion resolves disagreements.")
H("674.d.1.D",4,"When presenting a program to a non-technical audience, the best approach is to:","avoid jargon and use plain examples",["use as many acronyms as possible","read the source code line by line","speak quickly to save time"],"Audience-aware language improves understanding.")
H("674.d.1.E",3,"A program crashes only when a list is empty. Which step is the best critical-thinking move?","Reproduce the crash with an empty list and inspect the code path",["Rewrite the whole program at random","Blame the computer hardware","Delete the list feature"],"Reproducing a bug narrows down its cause.")
H("674.d.1.E",4,"Two algorithms solve the same problem. Which evidence best supports choosing one?","Measured run times on the same sample inputs",["Which one has a catchier name","Which was written first","Which uses more lines of code"],"Fair measurements give objective evidence.")
