H("674.d.2.C",3,"Which sequence best matches a systematic problem-solving process?","Define the problem, plan, implement, test, refine",["Test, define, hide, ship","Ship, plan, define, delete","Refine, ignore, implement, define"],"A systematic process moves from understanding to refining.")
